      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "German immigrants founded Bausch & Lomb in 1861, and George Eastman started Eastman Kodak in 1892, turning Rochester into a photography capital.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rochester%2C_New_York",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Xerox began as the Haloid Company in Rochester in 1906, later becoming a global leader in copying technology.",
